  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Weber uses an alternative folded accordion fold structure with multiple fold-down pages to form both an evocative and intimate page turning expereince or an exhuberant immersive gallery style paper sculpture which serves as a spectacular vehicle for Weber's photographs of the Occupy Wall Street and Eric Garner protest marches in New York City, a protest march of the Tibetan commuinity in Brisbane Australia, the Woman's March in Olympia Washington after Donald Trump was appointed President, and other more personal protests.--Booklyn Artists Alliance website, viewed on September 27, 2018.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
